## Fonts embedded by egui

The crate `epaint_default_fonts` embeds four fonts in `apiforge-desktop`.
Their licence texts are below, under `epaint_default_fonts`:

- Hack (`Hack-Regular.ttf`): MIT License and Bitstream Vera License, in `fonts/Hack-Regular.txt`
- Ubuntu-Light (`Ubuntu-Light.ttf`): Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0, in `fonts/UFL.txt`
- NotoEmoji (`NotoEmoji-Regular.ttf`): SIL Open Font License 1.1, in `fonts/OFL.txt`
- emoji-icon-font (`emoji-icon-font.ttf`): MIT License, in `fonts/emoji-icon-font-mit-license.txt`

The fonts API Forge bundles itself are described in `licenses/FONT-SOURCES.md`.

